                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>3</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16218252" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 25 Oct 2017 08:33:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In the scope of &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6030&quot; title=&quot;Allow enabling persistence per-cache&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6030&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6030&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; it looks like there is no much sense to have checkpoint page buffer size in DataStorageConfiguration. The checkpoint page buffer size should be moved to DataRegionConfiguration, then the size calculation will be straightforward.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16218337" author="ptupitsyn" created="Wed, 25 Oct 2017 10:05:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Moved &lt;tt&gt;CheckpointPageBufferSize&lt;/tt&gt; to &lt;tt&gt;DataRegionConfiguration&lt;/tt&gt; on .NET side.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16220097" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 26 Oct 2017 07:33:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master and ignite-2.3&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
